  "title": {
    "zh": "封闭支线取件",
    "en": "Spur Line Recovery"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "两侧支线 · 扫描取件 · 同一套程序",
    "en": "Spurs on both sides · Sensor pickups · One program"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "沿中间轨道抵达右侧出口之前，把支线上所有零件带走。支线只深一格，每种场景的支线位置不同。跳过没有零件的方向。移动和拾取各用 1 回合，每张地图最多 17 回合，扫描免费。",
    "en": "Collect every part from the spurs before reaching the exit at the right end of the main track. Each spur is one tile deep and their positions change between maps. Skip directions without a part. Moves and pickups cost one turn each, with 17 turns per map. Scans are free."
  },
